==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Hog Wild Harley]] in order to do [[Quest:The Water Must Flow!]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
==Goals==
Wheelie Pete would like some Oasis Water from Sandscale Oasis in Sunstone Valley.
*Collect Oasis Water from Sandscale Oasis - /4
*Return to Wheelie Pete
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"I'd like to brew more of my famous Sunstone Sasparilla, but I’m out of oasis water! It’s a critical ingredient and those Sandscale manguana have been hoarding it.<br />Think you can <font color='#D9781A'>get me some Oasis Water from Sandscale Oasis</font>?" -Wheelie Pete
#Enter the [[Sandscale Oasis]] [[:Category:Battle|Battle]] found North-West of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]]
#Collect Oasis Water from Sandscale Oasis - /4
#*Collect [[Oasis Water]] found in the Oasis along the path, Watch out for [[Jumping Cactus|Jumping Cacti]]!
#Speak with [[Wheelie Pete]] located in front of [[Wheelie Pete's Roadhouse]] in [[Sunstone Valley]].
#*"Thanks for bringing me this Oasis Water, <Player Name>! I’ll make sure you get the first barrel of Sunstone Sasparilla I brew with it.<br />But first I need one more ingredient." -Wheelie Pete

